Intrinsic resistor thermal noise control, not a sensor ADC
load "resistor.osdi"
load "capacitor.osdi"
model r resistor
model c capacitor
model i isource
r1 (out 0) r r=10000
c1 (out 0) c c=1n
i1 (0 out) i dc=0
control
  abort always
  options temp=27 rawfile="binary" strictsave=1
  options reltol=1e-5 vntol=1e-10 abstol=1e-15 tran_noisedebug=1
  save v(out)
  analysis transient tran stop=20m step=10n maxstep=100n noisefmax=1000000 noisefmin=10 oversample=12 noiseseed=11 noisemode="zoh"
  analysis stationary noise out="out" in="i1" from=10 to=1meg mode="dec" points=80
endc
